      <p class="text-[17px] text-muted-foreground max-w-[64ch]">A streamable MCP server ships in the box — point Claude, Codex, Cursor, or any agent at it and build by talking. Every tool call runs through your permissions DSL, with a per-key tool allowlist and read-only guards.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Three-up: tools / guards / connect (minimal) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-3 max-[1020px]:grid-cols-1 gap-3.5">
