        </div>
        <p class="text-[12.5px] text-muted-foreground leading-snug">Every admin capability is an MCP tool — grouped, type-validated, and DSL-filtered before it runs.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-border rounded-3xl bg-card p-5 flex flex-col gap-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="7.5" cy="15.5" r="5.5"/><path d="m21 2-9.6 9.6"/><path d="m15.5 7.5 3 3L22 7l-3-3"/></svg>
