        </div>
        <p class="text-[12.5px] text-muted-foreground leading-snug">Bind a tool allowlist and a read-only flag to any access key — agents inherit the guards of the key they used.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-border rounded-3xl bg-card p-5 flex flex-col gap-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m12 2 4 4-4 4"/><path d="M2 8h14"/><path d="m12 22-4-4 4-4"/><path d="M22 16H8"/></svg>
